       eeyyuuvvttooppppmm [----wwiiddtthh _w_i_d_t_h] [----hheeiigghhtt _h_e_i_g_h_t] [_e_y_u_v_f_i_l_e]


DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       eeyyuuvvttooppppmm  reads  a  Berkeley  Encoder YUV (not the same as Abekas YUV)
       file as input and produces a PPM image on Standard Output.

       With no filename argument takes input from Standard Input.   Otherwise,
       _e_y_u_v_f_i_l_e  is the file specification of the input file.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In  addition  to  the options common to all programs based on libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), eeyyuuvvttooppppmm recognizes  the
       following command line options:




       ----wwiiddtthh _w_i_d_t_h
              Width of the image, in pixels.  Must be an even number.


       ----hheeiigghhtt _h_e_i_g_h_t
              Height of the image, in pixels.  Must be an even number.



       These options are mandatory.



